[
    {
        "content": "<p>\"Alter &amp; tailor platforms.\"</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/scottc/roc-platform-patcher\">https://github.com/scottc/roc-platform-patcher</a></p>\n<p>So for example... <code>roc-lang/basic-cli@0.26.0</code></p>\n<p>Let's say you wanted to instrument the effects, and have an effects monitoring dashboard... with the ability to observe &amp; alter effects. Or monitor memory allocations etc. Inject any kind of middleware.</p>\n<p>Replace effects with noops stubs, crashes, alternative hotswappable dynamic <code>dlopen</code> behaviour.</p>\n<p>Or generate mock function calls, fuzzing, in both directions.. towards the app and towards the platform etc.</p>\n<p>Or even delete or add platform apis... useful for hardening, or expanding platform functionality, so apps can have access to more or less apis.</p>\n<p>Inject dev tooling... display a GUI or websever with various dashboards &amp; tools.</p>\n<p>Well now you can do that... automatically &amp; generically across any platforms.</p>\n<p>The repo is just a small trivial example of what is possible.</p>",
        "id": 636239715,
        "sender_full_name": "Scott Campbell",
        "timestamp": 1793353128
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>How it works:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Bash\"><pre><span></span><code>roc<span class=\"w\"> </span>app/rpp.roc<span class=\"w\"> </span>--<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span>--input<span class=\"o\">=</span>GddgvsGjiNXrHFW6au5i5dUDbTs8FinQdrgE2Gqmw53t.tar.zst<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span>--output-dir<span class=\"o\">=</span>patched\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Haskell\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">List</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">OsStr</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ow\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Try</span><span class=\"p\">({},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kr\">_</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ow\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ow\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">parse_args</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">Stdout</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"roc-platform-patcher (rpp) v0\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">Stdout</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"  input:  ${config.input}\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">Stdout</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"  target: ${config.target}\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">Stdout</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"  work:   ${config.work_dir}\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">Stdout</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"  out:    ${config.output_dir}\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">unpack</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">symbols</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ow\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inspect</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rename_originals</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">symbols</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">generate_proxies</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">symbols</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rebuild</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">symbols</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">write_metadata</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">symbols</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">repack</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">Stdout</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">Stdout</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"Done. Point an app at: ${config.output_dir}/\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">Stdout</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"Treat the result as a debug build.\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">Ok</span><span class=\"p\">({})</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 636239745,
        "sender_full_name": "Scott Campbell",
        "timestamp": 1793353136
    },
